  "brief": { "zh": "穿过灯塔堡的双环通道，让四台对手全部停机。两台守点机镇守对角灯塔，两台追击机可以离开内环。第 10、21 和 32 回合结束时内墙的门换到另一侧。机器人占着的门格会保持开启。第 60 回合结束前获胜，芽芽也必须留在场上。", "en": "Navigate the citadel rings and tag out all four rivals. Two sentries hold diagonally opposite beacons and two hunters can leave the inner ring. Inner-wall gates switch sides after turns 10, 21 and 32. An occupied gate stays open for that shift. Win by turn 60 with Sprout still on the field." },
