  "solutionCode": "def walk(direction, squares):\n    for step in range(squares):\n        move(direction)\n\nmove(\"up\")\npick()\n\nmove(\"right\")\nmove(\"up\")\npick()\n\nmove(\"up\")\npick()\n\nmove(\"up\")\nwalk(\"right\", 2)\nfor beat in range(2):\n    shoot(\"down\")\n\nmove(\"up\")\npick()\n\nfor beat in range(2):\n    shoot(\"right\")\n\nshoot(\"down\")\n\nmove(\"right\")\nwalk(\"down\", 3)\nwalk(\"right\", 5)\nshoot(\"left\")\n\nwalk(\"right\", 2)\nwalk(\"up\", 3)\nmove(\"right\")\nwalk(\"up\", 3)\nwalk(\"right\", 2)\nfor beat in range(2):\n    shoot(\"up\")\n",
